# Loaded by `npm run dev`. The dev server proxies /api → MOCK_ORIGIN
# (http://localhost:4000 by default), stripping the prefix — see vite.config.ts.
#
# Keep this pointing at the proxy. A *development* build that names the deployed
# origin instead talks to production: the local mock server is then bypassed
# entirely, so nothing in db.json and no edit to server.mjs has any effect, and
# the symptom is a page that looks stale rather than an error. That has already
# cost a debugging session — see docs/REGRESSIONS.md.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
